"""Detect introductions of serial numbers and symbolic identifiers.

Negative responses mark `No.`, identifier names, hash references, and the
punctuation opening their values. Ordinary prose and Markdown headings are
mostly left alone. Coefficients approximate training means, not an exact
model of the component. A 160-character buffer resets between documents.
