    token, doc = prefix.token_strings[-1], prefix.document_ids[-1]
    if carry is None or carry[0] != doc:
        previous, position = '', 0
    else:
        _, previous, position = carry
    value = activation(token, previous)
    word = token.strip()
    if position == 0 and word.isascii() and word.isalpha():
        value += 0.40
    return (doc, token, position + 1), value

"""A document-opening lexical/formatting pulse, zero after the opening run.

Document-opening delimiters, digits and articles are mostly negative. Software
entity words and here/there are positive, especially with a leading space.
NUL and document-boundary markers have separate fixed responses. This models
broad classes, leaving substantial word-specific variation unexplained.
