"""Detect language about achieving, preserving, or requiring a result.

The strongest cues are purpose/result constructions ("so that", "such
that", "make sure", "while still") and verbs of enabling or ensuring.
Infinitives and references to a desired state strengthen these verb cues.
Selected multilingual purpose/complement markers receive similar scores.
Only two previous tokens and a short recent text are retained, with a reset
at document boundaries. This is a lexical approximation, not a parser.
